# Crafter gamebots' own lines (Crafting 2.0 WP4, BotCrafterVoice). New writing (see docs/bot-voices).
# The truth rule: a line that names stock needs the stock. Every advert here is said only for a piece the crafter
# really made and still holds; {stock} is its name, {quality} its real quality and {price} the price it asks.

@kind trade
@topic crafted_stock
@who Crafter
@needs has_craft_stock
@levels 1-50
@invites trade
wts {stock}, {quality}% quality, {price}
[wts|selling] {stock} {quality}%, {price}[, pst|, send a tell|]
fresh off my bench: {stock}, {quality}%, asking {price}
made a {quality}% {stock} today, {price} if anyone wants it
{stock} for sale, {quality}%, {price} obo
@invites
anyone need {stock}? {quality}% and only {price}
[got|have] a {stock} at {quality}%, {price}, will post it at the broker otherwise

@kind craft
@topic title
@who Crafter
@needs crafter_title_up
@levels 1-50
{title} at last
[finally|woo,] {title}[!|]
just hit {skill}, {title} now
{title}. my purse is lighter than my hammer
{title} today, all those failed combines paid off
